  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Reads the keyboard once a frame. F1 set-up, F7 start, F3 music or effects, F5 pause, CTRL+V version, Q quit."},
    {"at":2,"placement":"side","text":"Port A drives the key rows, port B reads the key columns."},
    {"at":10,"placement":"side","text":"Row 7: bit 2 is CTRL."},
    {"at":22,"placement":"side","text":"Row 3: bit 7 is V."},
    {"at":34,"placement":"line","text":"Shows text $81 (\"V 05 05 87\") while CTRL and V stay pressed."},
    {"at":46,"placement":"side","text":"Removes the text from the screen when V is released."},
    {"at":49,"placement":"side","text":"Row 0: bit 4 is F1."},
    {"at":61,"placement":"side","text":"F1 has no effect during set-up, during a started game, or after a fighter died."},
    {"at":71,"placement":"side","text":"Starts the set-up: opponent 0, one player, demo off."},
    {"at":83,"placement":"side","text":"Goes back to scene 0 when scene 1 shows."},
    {"at":90,"placement":"side","text":"Resets the fighters and the sprite tables."},
    {"at":96,"placement":"side","text":"Mirrors the fighter sprites back when they are mirrored."},
    {"at":107,"placement":"side","text":"Before F7, F1 also resets the bout clock and selects one player."},
    {"at":118,"placement":"side","text":"Row 0: bit 5 is F3."},
    {"at":130,"placement":"side","text":"Fades out and stops the sound before the change."},
    {"at":133,"placement":"side","text":"Toggles bit 7 of music_on."},
    {"at":141,"placement":"side","text":"Music on: requests sounds $80-$82 on the three voices."},
    {"at":153,"placement":"side","text":"Starts a fade-in of the volume."},
    {"at":157,"placement":"side","text":"Row 0: bit 6 is F5."},
    {"at":169,"placement":"side","text":"F5 has no effect during the set-up."},
    {"at":173,"placement":"side","text":"Stores set-up flag $ba (0 here) in sprites_frozen. Thus the sprites do not stop."},
    {"at":175,"placement":"side","text":"Waits, so that the player can release F5."},
    {"at":178,"placement":"side","text":"Halts the main loop until F5 is pressed again."},
    {"at":187,"placement":"side","text":"Clears the text area of the screen."},
    {"at":190,"placement":"side","text":"Row 0: bit 3 is F7."},
    {"at":202,"placement":"side","text":"F7 works only during the set-up."},
    {"at":206,"placement":"side","text":"Starts the game: game_started gets $80, the set-up ends, the bout clock resets."},
    {"at":215,"placement":"side","text":"Row 7: bit 6 is Q."},
    {"at":227,"placement":"side","text":"Q quits to the demo."},
    {"at":230,"placement":"side","text":"Sets both ports to input again for the joystick reads."}
  ],
